16. we have to ====typescript eslint web side to set == install
npm install --save-dev eslint @eslint/js typescript typescript-eslint
and create this file =====in root file ====== eslint.config.mjs
and keep these codes ========= 
// @ts-check

import eslint from '@eslint/js';
import tseslint from 'typescript-eslint';

export default tseslint.config(
  eslint.configs.recommended,
  tseslint.configs.recommended,
);

and also keep this codes same file because of not keeping unused variable in our codes 
